WEBVTT

00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.800
I(t) is the share of people using the word. It rises as the word spreads, while Γ(t) starts low.

00:00:06.800 --> 00:00:11.600
After the peak, Γ keeps rising and pulls I(t) down.

00:00:11.600 --> 00:00:17.800
The more people have used it, the faster they move on.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Γ is the recovery rate: how fast people in I move to R. In this model it grows over time.
